# Seq pattern: match head and tail.
# T-1154: [Seq h t] no longer binds h/t (both are Pattern::Pin — wildcard, no binding).
# Use [case [let p] [Seq.Cons p] p.head] to bind the payload dict and access head.
[match [seq 1 [seq 2 [seq 3 []]]]
  [case [let p] [Seq.Cons p] p.head]
  _:                         0]
=== out
Int(1)
